OL,3,ASearch and rescue teams race against
OL,4,Atime to find survivors after Nigeria
OL,5,Aboat tragedy
OL,6,
OL,7,FOvercrowding, poor maintenance and
OL,8,Ffailure to observe safety regulations
OL,9,Fhave contributed to previous deadly
OL,10,Faccidents on Nigeria's rivers.
